><surname>Teneng</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Stribinskis</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Brun</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Computational and biological inference of gene regulatory networks of the LINE-1 retrotransposon</article-title><source>Genomics</source><year>2007</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>176</fpage><lpage>185</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17521869</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ygeno.2007.04.003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Balagurunathan</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Dougherty</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Afshari</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>He</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramos</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Insight into redox-regulated gene networks in vascular cells</article-title><source>Bioinformation</source><year>2007</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>379</fpage><lpage>383</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17597926</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>